(6261239, 925315, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL!  I''m not sure what you look like without exploded toast on your face, but I think we''re twins.  I had a very confused moment when this appeared and I thought that was me, and couldn''t recall doing this shot.  Even our eyes are the same color!</td>', 'LOL!  I''m not sure what you look like without exploded toast on your face, but I think we''re twins.  I had a very confused moment when this appeared and I thought that was me, and couldn''t recall doing this shot.  Even our eyes are the same color!', '2010-12-25 12:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6261240, 926180, 96751, '<td valign="top">That building looks like a walkie talkie, or a trash can with the lid up.  Love the tones and the gradient of the drops.</td>', 'That building looks like a walkie talkie, or a trash can with the lid up.  Love the tones and the gradient of the drops.', '2010-12-25 12:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
