(6261372, 925592, 96751, '<td valign="top">Marvelous framing.  Love the spokes on the arch.  And I love it when trees look like that.  This is truly a winter wonderland.</td>', 'Marvelous framing.  Love the spokes on the arch.  And I love it when trees look like that.  This is truly a winter wonderland.', '2010-12-25 23:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
