(6261394, 926133, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmm.  This is such a lovely portrait, and I guess technically, this would be someone inside, looking out.  Not how I would have interpreted this challenge, and certainly different from most of the entries.</td>', 'Hmmmmm.  This is such a lovely portrait, and I guess technically, this would be someone inside, looking out.  Not how I would have interpreted this challenge, and certainly different from most of the entries.', '2010-12-25 23:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6261395, 926020, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL!  This made me think of those peanut M&amp;Ms in the commercials, on the check out line.  Great dof, but makes my eyes feel weird because they struggle to focus on the far objects outside, but are confused by the in-focus droplets up close.  Nicely done.</td>', 'LOL!  This made me think of those peanut M&Ms in the commercials, on the check out line.  Great dof, but makes my eyes feel weird because they struggle to focus on the far objects outside, but are confused by the in-focus droplets up close.  Nicely done.', '2010-12-25 23:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
