(6261397, 925717, 96751, '<td valign="top">A bunch of inside the refrigerator images.  And all of them free of condensation.  I''m wondering how you all did that??!!</td>', 'A bunch of inside the refrigerator images.  And all of them free of condensation.  I''m wondering how you all did that??!!', '2010-12-25 23:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6261398, 926115, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is so incredible.  My first impression is WTHAILA!!??? (what the heck am I looking at).  Then slowly, the mist cleared and I could make out the lips.  I still don''t know what they''re on the verge of (or about to do), but the mystery and the mist, and the glowing shapes make this one of my favorite artsy images of the challenge.</td>', 'This is so incredible.  My first impression is WTHAILA!!??? (what the heck am I looking at).  Then slowly, the mist cleared and I could make out the lips.  I still don''t know what they''re on the verge of (or about to do), but the mystery and the mist, and the glowing shapes make this one of my favorite artsy images of the challenge.', '2010-12-25 23:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6261399, 926018, 96751, '<td valign="top">Awwww.  I think that makes "awww" number 7 in this challenge.  Great framing, and I love that the tones are all in the same family.</td>', 'Awwww.  I think that makes "awww" number 7 in this challenge.  Great framing, and I love that the tones are all in the same family.', '2010-12-25 23:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
